#. module: product_contract_minimum_term
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:product_contract_minimum_term.selection__product_contract_configurator__contract_duration_type__fixed
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:product_contract_minimum_term.selection__product_template__contract_duration_type__fixed
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:product_contract_minimum_term.selection__sale_order_line__contract_duration_type__fixed
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:product_contract_minimum_term.selection__sale_order_line_contract_mixin__contract_duration_type__fixed
msgid "Fixed Duration"
msgstr "Feste Laufzeit"

#. module: product_contract_minimum_term
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_contract_minimum_term.field_product_product__contract_duration_type
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_contract_minimum_term.field_product_template__contract_duration_type
msgid ""
"Fixed Duration: the contract line ends after the duration, it can be renewed automatically.\n"
"Minimum Term: the contract line is open-ended, it cannot be terminated before the end of the minimum term, which is extended by the renewal term if the contract is not terminated in time."
msgstr ""
"Feste Laufzeit: Die Vertragszeile endet nach der Laufzeit und kann automatisch erneuert werden.\n"
"Mindestvertragsdauer: Die Vertragszeile ist unbefristet und kann nicht vor Ende der Mindestvertragsdauer gekündigt werden. Wird nicht rechtzeitig gekündigt, verlängert sich die Mindestvertragsdauer um die Verlängerungsdauer."

#. module: product_contract_minimum_term
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_contract_minimum_term.field_product_contract_configurator__min_term_renewal_interval
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_contract_minimum_term.field_product_template__min_term_renewal_interval
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_contract_minimum_term.field_sale_order_line__min_term_renewal_interval
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_contract_minimum_term.field_sale_order_line_contract_mixin__min_term_renewal_interval
msgid ""
"If the contract is not terminated in time, the minimum term is extended by "
"this term. Leave 0 to not extend the minimum term: once it is over, the "
"contract can be terminated at any time respecting the termination notice."
msgstr ""
"Wird der Vertrag nicht rechtzeitig gekündigt, verlängert sich die "
"Mindestvertragsdauer um diese Dauer. 0 bedeutet keine Verlängerung: Nach "
"Ablauf der Mindestvertragsdauer kann der Vertrag jederzeit unter Einhaltung "
"der Kündigungsfrist gekündigt werden."

#. module: product_contract_minimum_term
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_contract_minimum_term.field_product_contract_configurator__min_term_interval
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_contract_minimum_term.field_product_template__min_term_interval
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_contract_minimum_term.field_sale_order_line__min_term_interval
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_contract_minimum_term.field_sale_order_line_contract_mixin__min_term_interval
msgid ""
"Initial minimum term, counted from the start date. Leave 0 to disable the "
"minimum term."
msgstr ""
"Anfängliche Mindestvertragsdauer ab dem Startdatum. 0 bedeutet keine "
"Mindestvertragsdauer."

