#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_contract_minimum_term.field_sale_order_line_contract_mixin__min_term_notice_interval
msgid ""
"The termination has to be received at least this long before the end of the "
"minimum term (or before the termination date once the minimum term is over)."
msgstr ""
"Die Kündigung muss mindestens so lange vor Ende der Mindestvertragsdauer "
"eingelangt sein (bzw. vor dem Kündigungsdatum, wenn die Mindestvertragsdauer"
" abgelaufen ist)."
